      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the weight of the entire system feels crushing, making any small relief seem completely inadequate. When the entire structure feels fundamentally abusive or meaningless, the urge to opt out feels very real. Before making any drastic choices based on this pain, could you allow me to strongly encourage you to talk to a professional? They can help you navigate these intense feelings of hopelessness outside of the pressure of your work.",
      "source": "target",
